{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05872","headline":"晦日游大理韦卿城南别业四声依次用各六韵 一 · 王维","name":"晦日游大理韦卿城南别业四声依次用各六韵 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"与世澹无事，自然江海人。\n侧闻尘外游，解骖𨋗朱轮\n平野照暄景，上天垂春云。\n张组竟北阜，泛舟过东邻。\n故乡信高会，牢醴及佳辰。\n幸同击壤乐，心荷尧爲君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05872.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05872","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}